NC"},{"bioguideId":"B001302","fullName":"Rep. Biggs, Andy [R-AZ-5]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"AZ"},{"bioguideId":"Y000067","fullName":"Rep. Yakym, Rudy [R-IN-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IN"},{"bioguideId":"T000165","fullName":"Rep. Tiffany, Thomas P. [R-WI-7]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WI"},{"bioguideId":"V000133","fullName":"Rep. Van Drew, Jefferson [R-NJ-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NJ"},{"bioguideId":"S001228","fullName":"Rep. Schmidt, Derek [R-KS-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-05","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"KS"},{"bioguideId":"B001291","fullName":"Rep. Babin, Brian [R-TX-36]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-06","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"},{"bioguideId":"E000300","fullName":"Rep. Evans, Gabe [R-CO-8]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-11","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CO"},{"bioguideId":"D000032","fullName":"Rep. Donalds, Byron [R-FL-19]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-11","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"FL"},{"bioguideId":"H001102","fullName":"Rep. Harris, Mark [R-NC-8]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-05","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"S001229","fullName":"Rep. Shreve, Jefferson [R-IN-6]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-10","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IN"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T18:45:01+00:00","id":"hr175-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-03","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-06-03","text":"Ordered to be Reported (Amended) by the Yeas and Nays: 15 - 8."},"laws":[],"number":"175","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Immigration","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"M001177","district":5,"fullName":"Rep. McClintock, Tom [R-CA-5]","party":"R","state":"CA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-03","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Deport Alien Gang Members Act</strong></p><p>This bill makes non-U.S. nationals (<em>aliens</em> under federal law) associated with criminal gangs inadmissible for entry into the United States and deportable. The bill also establishes procedures to designate groups as criminal gangs.</p><p>An individual shall be inadmissible if certain officers or agencies know or have reason to believe that the individual is or was a criminal gang member or has participated or aided such a group's illegal activities. An individual who is or was a member of such a gang, has participated or aided such a group's illegal activities,&nbsp;or seeks to enter or has entered the United States in furtherance of such activity&nbsp;shall be deportable.</p><p>Such individuals must be subject to mandatory detention. Furthermore, such individuals shall not be eligible for (1) asylum; (2) temporary protected status; (3) special immigrant juvenile visas; or (4) parole, unless they are assisting the government in a law enforcement matter.</p><p>The bill defines a criminal gang as a group of five or more persons (1) where one of its primary purposes is committing specified criminal offenses and its members have engaged in a continuing series of such offenses within the past five years, or (2) that has been designated as a criminal gang by the Department of Homeland Security&nbsp;(DHS).</p><p>The bill also establishes procedures for DHS to designate a group as a criminal gang, including notifying Congress, publishing a notice in the Federal Register, and providing an opportunity for the group to petition for review of the designation.</p>","updateDate":"2025-02-14T21:47:13Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Deport Alien Gang Members Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-06-06T08:06:26Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-06-06T08:06:26Z"}
